WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:02.118
iOS 27 fixes

00:00:01.930 --> 00:00:02.814
the weak Wi-Fi

00:00:02.626 --> 00:00:03.250
trap

00:00:03.774 --> 00:00:05.389
iOS 27 adds

00:00:05.201 --> 00:00:06.450
Connectivity Assist

00:00:06.486 --> 00:00:07.712
which notices when

00:00:07.524 --> 00:00:08.856
Wi-Fi is slow

00:00:08.668 --> 00:00:09.917
or unusable and

00:00:09.729 --> 00:00:11.038
uses cellular data

00:00:10.861 --> 00:00:11.486
to keep your

00:00:11.298 --> 00:00:12.394
iPhone connected

00:00:12.934 --> 00:00:13.735
Think of leaving

00:00:13.547 --> 00:00:14.443
the house while

00:00:14.255 --> 00:00:15.245
your phone clings

00:00:15.057 --> 00:00:15.775
to weak home

00:00:15.587 --> 00:00:16.342
Wi-Fi

00:00:16.481 --> 00:00:17.176
You'll find the

00:00:16.988 --> 00:00:18.214
toggle in Settings

00:00:18.037 --> 00:00:19.039
under Wi-Fi

00:00:19.574 --> 00:00:20.246
You can turn

00:00:20.058 --> 00:00:20.682
it off for

00:00:20.494 --> 00:00:21.967
specific networks it

00:00:21.803 --> 00:00:22.746
isn't used while

00:00:22.558 --> 00:00:23.500
roaming or in

00:00:23.312 --> 00:00:24.196
Low Data Mode

00:00:24.244 --> 00:00:24.833
and it may

00:00:24.645 --> 00:00:25.871
use more cellular

00:00:25.683 --> 00:00:26.260
data

00:00:26.790 --> 00:00:27.804
Full story on

00:00:27.615 --> 00:00:28.511
the dashboard
